    "profile_text": {
        "body": "XPENG INC. is a public company headquartered in Guangzhou, trading under the ticker XPEV. Its SEC Central Index Key is 0001810997. The company's Spanish website presents XPENG as an electric vehicle maker active since 2014, offering the G6, G9, and P7+ models in Spain.\n\nThe site describes these models as combining artificial intelligence, advanced driver assistance systems, and an 800-volt platform called SEPA 2.0, which it says can charge from 10% to 80% in 12 minutes across the range. The three models carry the DGT CERO label and a warranty of up to 7 years or 160,000 km. In Spain, the data controller for inquiries is CAETANO AUTOMOTIVE ESPAÑA DISTRIBUCIÓN, S.L.U., and financing offers are subject to approval by Open Bank, S.A.\n\nNo litigation is noted in the available facts.",
